  "title": "Legislative election of 2015",
  "summary": "The Portugal à Frente coalition of the PSD and the CDS-PP won the most votes on 4 October 2015 and lost its absolute majority; the PS, the Bloco de Esquerda, the PCP and the Greens together held a majority of the seats. Which of the two readings of that result — the largest list, or the arithmetic of the chamber — should produce a government was the question the following seven weeks answered.",
